  "html": "<table cellpadding=\"4px\" style=\"border: 1px solid gray; margin: 0px 15%;\">\n<tr>\n<td> <a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Exclamation.png\" title=\"Image:Exclamation.png\"><img alt=\"Image:Exclamation.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/recovered/Exclamation.png\" width=\"96\"/></a>\n</td><td>\n<p><b>This page is possibly outdated and needs updating, please help us getting it up to date again.</b>\n</p><p>Information on this page might be outdated, and thats why we need <b>your</b> help to make this page Up-to-date again!\n</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Acidic Blight\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Acidic-blight.png\" title=\"Image:Acidic-blight.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Acidic-blight.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"57\" src=\"/images/recovered/Acidic-blight.png\" width=\"55\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Curses\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Reduces <a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Rating\" title=\"Defense Rating\">Defense Rate</a> for X% on X amount of enemies within 4.5 meters for 30 seconds\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Acidic Blight</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Curses\" title=\"Curses\">Curse skill</a> that lowers <a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Rating\" title=\"Defense Rating\">Defense Rate</a> for a certain amount of enemies within 4.5 meters lasting a certain amount of seconds. It is commonly used for boss farming, because of higher damage when the defense is lower. When cast you will see a circle of dust spreading out over a circle of 4.5 meters.\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> 45 Seconds\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Lowers the Defense rate for X% on Y amount of enemies within 4.5 meters for 30 seconds when activated</b>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 4\n</td><td> 14\n</td><td> 24\n</td><td> 34\n</td><td> 44\n</td><td> 54\n</td><td> 64\n</td><td> 74\n</td><td> 84\n</td><td> 94\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">X\n</td><td> 25\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 65\n</td><td> 70\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Y\n</td><td> 8\n</td><td> 9\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 11\n</td><td> 12\n</td><td> 14\n</td><td> 16\n</td><td> 18\n</td><td> 20\n</td><td> 22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 29.7\n</td><td> 54\n</td><td> 78.3\n</td><td> 102.6\n</td><td> 126.9\n</td><td> 151.2\n</td><td> 175.5\n</td><td> 199.8\n</td><td> 224.1\n</td><td> 248.4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 4454\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
